    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil spreads, and demons run rampant. Manage the Pagoda, and shelter the people.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the invasion, gather resources and strengthen your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/e2c0a4087125353abf824331d001adee.poster.avif?t=1738678065\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/e2c0a4087125353abf824331d001adee.webm?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/e2c0a4087125353abf824331d001adee.mp4?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill pilgrims' prayers to earn offerings of copper coins and materials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/8f2888b0a8736215694d82d0c7b10ca1.poster.avif?t=1738678065\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/8f2888b0a8736215694d82d0c7b10ca1.webm?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/8f2888b0a8736215694d82d0c7b10ca1.mp4?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Upgrade formation scrolls to boost combat attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demon Invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/354d3bf7684f899645c31bc7e6235bf8.poster.avif?t=1738678065\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/354d3bf7684f899645c31bc7e6235bf8.webm?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/354d3bf7684f899645c31bc7e6235bf8.mp4?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/fd3da8a8d96e0fd66f556c892766b44b.poster.avif?t=1738678065\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/fd3da8a8d96e0fd66f556c892766b44b.webm?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/fd3da8a8d96e0fd66f556c892766b44b.mp4?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deploy, Reach, and Collect.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Divine Power, deploy Talismans, and collect Mana upon reaching again to level up your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/56b860a9f7f83251be891f8c411f33d8.poster.avif?t=1738678065\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/56b860a9f7f83251be891f8c411f33d8.webm?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/56b860a9f7f83251be891f8c411f33d8.mp4?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice to compete with Talisman points. The outcome is uncertain\u2014victory or defeat can go either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/ff796c1fce78474cea30bb7d2bbb3650.poster.avif?t=1738678065\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/ff796c1fce78474cea30bb7d2bbb3650.webm?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331170/extras/ff796c1fce78474cea30bb7d2bbb3650.mp4?t=1738678065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deploy Tokens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy tokens to change the movement of both players and enemies, avoiding damage. Control your fate by navigating through randomness.</p>",
